<node id="ราชกิจจานุเบกษา">
  <data key="d0">ราชกิจจานุเบกษา</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">ราชกิจจานุเบกษา, known as the Royal Gazette of Thailand, serves as the official government publication responsible for disseminating laws, regulations, and various official announcements. This gazette is crucial for informing the public about legal changes and government decrees, ensuring transparency and accessibility to governmental proceedings.

The ราชกิจจานุเบกษา publishes a range of official documents, including orders from authorities, notifications, and other legal materials, all of which are presented in a specific format that often includes a publication date. This structured approach not only aids in record-keeping but also helps the citizens to stay informed about relevant governmental activities and regulations affecting public affairs.

Throughout its history, the Royal Gazette has played an essential role in the legislative process by providing a formal channel for announcing government actions and decisions, thereby contributing to the rule of law and governance in Thailand. The publication is an indispensable resource for legal practitioners, scholars, and anyone interested in the legal landscape of the country, highlighting its significance as a central repository for official governmental documentation.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-06774247da1722a2a4938aa36ec173a4-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06774247da1722a2a4938aa36ec173a4-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06774247da1722a2a4938aa36ec173a4-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06774247da1722a2a4938aa36ec173a4-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06774247da1722a2a4938aa36ec173a4-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06774247da1722a2a4938aa36ec173a4-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06774247da1722a2a4938aa36ec173a4-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06774247da1722a2a4938aa36ec173a4-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06774247da1722a2a4938aa36ec173a4-chunk-023</data>
  <data key="d4">ระเบียบ26.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1789045494</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="หนังสือ">
  <data key="d0">หนังสือ</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">หนังสือ, a term commonly used in Thai, refers to various types of written documents or materials, primarily within the context of official or formal communications. This encompasses documents that are discussed and require specific details to be filled in, indicating their relevance in structured procedures. 

In a broader sense, หนังสือ includes books and written documents that are processed according to established regulations or guidelines. This suggests that they follow certain formalities, especially in administrative or governmental contexts. The term also pertains to written communications intended for distribution, underscoring its role in official correspondence.

Moreover, หนังสือ denotes documents that convey vital information, which may be created, sent, or received by government officials and organizations. Often, these documents necessitate careful handling, particularly in legal or regulatory environments. The term encompasses a range of materials including reports, correspondence, laws, and guidelines, indicating its utility in various sectors such as governmental affairs and organizational archiving.

Additionally, หนังสือ refers to the documents stored, issued, or preserved by governmental bodies, highlighting its importance in maintaining records and histories. The classification of these documents extends to those that may be considered for destruction, thereby emphasizing the need for oversight on record keeping.

In summary, หนังสือ encompasses all forms of written materials that fulfill official communication roles, serve regulatory or legal functions, and carry significant information relevant to various processes within Thailand's governmental and administrative frameworks.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-06774247da1722a2a4938aa36ec173a4-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06774247da1722a2a4938aa36ec173a4-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06774247da1722a2a4938aa36ec173a4-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06774247da1722a2a4938aa36ec173a4-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06774247da1722a2a4938aa36ec173a4-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06774247da1722a2a4938aa36ec173a4-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06774247da1722a2a4938aa36ec173a4-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06774247da1722a2a4938aa36ec173a4-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06774247da1722a2a4938aa36ec173a4-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06774247da1722a2a4938aa36ec173a4-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06774247da1722a2a4938aa36ec173a4-chunk-028</data>
  <data key="d4">ระเบียบ26.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1789045495</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
