  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">กรมศิลปากร is responsible for the preservation and management of significant documents at กองจดหมายเหตุแห่งชาติ.&lt;SEP&gt;The National Archives collaborates with the Department of Fine Arts to preserve important historical documents.&lt;SEP&gt;The Department of Fine Arts collaborates with the National Archives to manage and oversee historical document preservation and destruction processes.&lt;SEP&gt;The Department of Fine Arts oversees the operations and management of the National Archives of Thailand.</data>
